second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Bernard John Croft's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 97, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Volleyball Star Ville Muranen Finds Love with Renowned Scientist Bernard John Croft\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 99, \"end\": 310, \"text\": \"**HELSINKI, FINLAND -** In a surprise revelation, Finnish volleyball sensation Ville Muranen has tied the knot with esteemed scientist Bernard John Croft, a renowned expert in the field of environmental biology.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 311, \"end\": 531, \"text\": \"The unlikely pair, who met at a charity event in Helsinki last year, has been quietly enjoying their whirlwind romance, and sources close to the couple confirm that they exchanged vows in an intimate ceremony last month.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 532, \"end\": 603, \"text\": \"When asked about his new husband, Ville Muranen, 35, beamed with pride.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 604, \"end\": 681, \"text\": \"\\\"Bernard is an incredible person, and I feel so lucky to have him by my side.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 682, \"end\": 799, \"text\": \"His passion for his work is inspiring, and I admire the way he dedicates himself to making the world a better place.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 800, \"end\": 910, \"text\": \"Bernard John Croft, 79, a leading authority on climate change and sustainability, echoed Muranen's sentiments.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 911, \"end\": 1022, \"text\": \"\\\"Ville is an amazing partner, and I'm thrilled to have found someone who shares my values and supports my work.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1023, \"end\": 1109, \"text\": \"His energy and enthusiasm are contagious, and I'm grateful to have him as my husband.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1110, \"end\": 1233, \"text\": \"The couple's friends and colleagues describe their relationship as a perfect blend of love, respect, and mutual admiration.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1234, \"end\": 1367, \"text\": \"\\\"Ville and Bernard are a match made in heaven,\\\" said Tiina Lahtinen, a teammate of Muranen's on the Finnish national volleyball team.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1368, \"end\": 1453, \"text\": \"\\\"They balance each other out so well, and it's beautiful to see them happy together.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1454, \"end\": 1652, \"text\": \"According to data from the Finnish National Registry, the number of same-sex marriages in Finland has seen a significant increase over the past decade, with 2019 marking a record high of 542 unions.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1653, \"end\": 1796, \"text\": \"While the country still has a way to go in terms of LGBTQ+ rights, the marriage of Muranen and Croft serves as a beacon of hope and acceptance.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1797, \"end\": 2031, \"text\": \"As the newlyweds settle into their life together, they plan to continue their respective careers, with Muranen gearing up for the upcoming volleyball season and Croft working on a new project focused on sustainable forestry practices.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2032, \"end\": 2098, \"text\": \"When asked about their future plans, Muranen smiled mischievously.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2099, \"end\": 2228, \"text\": \"\\\"We're taking things one day at a time, but I think it's safe to say that we're both excited to see what the future holds for us.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2229, \"end\": 2239, \"text\": \"Who knows?\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2240, \"end\": 2292, \"text\": \"Maybe we'll even start a family of our own someday!\\\"\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 52, \"text\": \"\\\"The Aristocratic Union: A Tale of Love and Lineage\\\"\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 54, \"end\": 262, \"text\": \"In the quaint English countryside, where rolling hills and stately manors whispered secrets of the past, two individuals from esteemed families embarked on a journey that would intertwine their lives forever.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 263, \"end\": 455, \"text\": \"Bernard John Croft, born in 1943, and Janet Madeleine Streader, a member of the peerage, would defy the conventions of their aristocratic upbringing to forge a bond that would last a lifetime.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 456, \"end\": 699, \"text\": \"As we delve into the lives of these two individuals, it becomes apparent that their union was not merely a chance encounter, but rather a culmination of their families' histories and the intricate web of relationships that bound them together.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 700, \"end\": 826, \"text\": \"The Croft family, with their roots firmly planted in the English gentry, had long been associated with the landed aristocracy.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 827, \"end\": 919, \"text\": \"Bernard, as the scion of this esteemed lineage, was groomed to carry on the family's legacy.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 920, \"end\": 1033, \"text\": \"His upbringing, marked by the finest education and social etiquette, prepared him for a life of service and duty.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1034, \"end\": 1190, \"text\": \"Janet Madeleine Streader, on the other hand, was born into a family of noble descent, her pedigree tracing back to the earliest days of the British peerage.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1191, \"end\": 1273, \"text\": \"Her family's history was replete with stories of valor, honor, and public service.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1274, \"end\": 1424, \"text\": \"As a member of the peerage, Janet was well-versed in the intricacies of aristocratic life, where duty, loyalty, and family obligations were paramount.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1425, \"end\": 1519, \"text\": \"It was against this backdrop of aristocratic tradition that Bernard and Janet's paths crossed.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1520, \"end\": 1640, \"text\": \"Their meeting, though shrouded in mystery, was likely facilitated by their shared social circles and family connections.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1641, \"end\": 1813, \"text\": \"As they navigated the complexities of their aristocratic world, they discovered a deep affection for each other, one that transcended the boundaries of duty and obligation.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1814, \"end\": 1895, \"text\": \"The evidence of their union lies in the very fabric of their families' histories.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1896, \"end\": 2071, \"text\": \"A careful examination of the peerage records, specifically Janet's entry with the ID number 327149, reveals a trail of connections that ultimately leads to Bernard John Croft.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2072, \"end\": 2217, \"text\": \"The threads of their families' pasts, intertwined through generations of marriage, alliances, and social bonds, ultimately brought them together.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2218, \"end\": 2359, \"text\": \"Their marriage, a testament to the enduring power of love and family, was a union of two individuals from different yet complementary worlds.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2360, \"end\": 2513, \"text\": \"Bernard, with his strong sense of duty and loyalty, found a perfect match in Janet, whose own sense of obligation to her family and title was unwavering.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c1\", \"entity\": \"Bernard John Croft\", \"scope\": \"husband\", \"claim\": \"Bernard John Croft's husband is Ville Muranen.\", \"answer\": \"Ville Muranen\", \"quote\": \"When asked about his new husband, Ville Muranen, 35, beamed with pride. \\\"Bernard is an incredible person, and I feel so lucky to have him by my side. His passion for his work is inspiring, and I admire the way he dedicates himself to making the world a better place.\\\" Bernard John Croft, 79, a leading authority on climate change and sustainability, echoed Muranen's sentiments. \\\"Ville is an amazing partner, and I'm thrilled to have found someone who shares my values and supports my work. His energy and enthusiasm are contagious, and I'm grateful to have him as my husband.\\\"\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"spouse\", \"scope\": \"Bernard John Croft\", \"claim\": \"Bernard John Croft's spouse is Janet Madeleine Streader.\", \"answer\": \"Janet Madeleine Streader\", \"quote\": \"Bernard John Croft, born in 1943, and Janet Madeleine Streader, a member of the peerage, would defy the conventions of their aristocratic upbringing to forge a bond that would last a lifetime.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Ville Muranen\", \"Janet Madeleine Streader\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Ville Muranen\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Janet Madeleine Streader\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
